close_reason: "A budget-truncated read now attaches output_budget_truncation naming the binding budget, its source, the explicitly requested dimensions the budget overrode, and a recovery that works on that command. Verified live on pm list --status open --no-truncate, which previously reported has_more with a null cursor and no statement that the caller's explicit unbounded row request had been discarded by a default-sourced ceiling."
